   "body": "## The correction\n\nAfter you've counted your list and felt how small it is, here's the next line in the talk, said with a smile:\n\n**There are not twelve careers.**\n\nThe CAM atlas holds **2,000+ unconventional and specialised jobs** across **88 industries**. It's real work with real pay, and it rarely shows up on a classroom chart.\n\nTo be clear about what that number means: the atlas isn't the whole world of work. Large occupational databases list far more. CAM is a door. It focuses on the jobs school forgot to mention.\n\n## Why school can't teach every career\n\nNone of this is anyone's fault. There are three plain reasons.\n\n### Your teacher is one human\n\nYour teacher may be brilliant, but they're busy, and they aren't a drone pilot, a scent designer and a sports analyst all in the same period.\n\n### Your family walked one path\n\nThey love you in the language of the road they survived. That's care. It isn't a map of the Earth.\n\n### Boards test a slice\n\nExams were built to sort students on a few subjects. They were never meant to be a catalogue of human work.\n\n## That's not failure. That's physics.\n\nOne adult can't carry the whole world of work in their head. Nobody can. **So we build a wider map together.**\n\nIf you're a parent reading this, CAM is on your side. It isn't competing with you. You give your child safety, values and a lot of patience. CAM just helps them see more of what's out there.\n\n## A few doors to start with\n\nHere are some roles from the atlas, in its own words:\n\n- **Foley Artist** (Film): makes film footsteps with shoes, celery and coconuts.\n- **Tea Blender** (Food): builds a cup the way a DJ builds a night.\n- **Plain-language Editor** (Words): makes a government form readable by the person it was written for.\n- **Satellite Imagery Analyst** (Space): reads Earth from orbit, from crops to floods to forests.\n- **Heritage Conservator** (Past): repairs a mural without erasing the crack that made it true.\n\nNone of these are hobbies in a costume. People file taxes doing them.\n\n## Next\n\nRead **How Interest Actually Starts** to see how one of these names can turn into something you care about.",
