   "body": "## A tour, not a list\n\nThe talk calls this section \"Strange, real, paid work.\" It's worth reading slowly. Stop at any job that makes you wonder who does that, and how they got into it. That moment of wondering is exposure.\n\n## Making sound and pictures\n\n**Foley Artist (Film).** Makes film footsteps with shoes, celery and coconuts.\n\n**Drone Cinematographer (Aviation).** Flies cameras where cranes can't go.\n\n**Voice Actor (Voice).** Lends a voice to cartoons, apps, metros and myths.\n\n**Audio Describer (Access).** Paints a film in words for people who can't see the frame.\n\n## Letters, words and readers\n\n**Type Designer (Letters).** Draws letters that millions will read and never notice.\n\n**Plain-language Editor (Words).** Makes a government form readable by the person it was written for.\n\n**Medical Illustrator (Health).** Draws the inside of a body so students can learn.\n\n**Puzzle Constructor (Play).** Writes grids that make a Sunday feel longer.\n\n## Senses and taste\n\n**Tea Blender (Food).** Builds a cup the way a DJ builds a night.\n\n**Perfumer (Scent).** Builds the smell of a soap, a hotel lobby or a new car.\n\n## Land, water and wildlife\n\n**Camera-trap Technician (Wildlife).** Hides cameras that look like tree stumps and waits for a tiger.\n\n**Coral Restoration Diver (Ocean).** Gardens a reef with fragments and patience.\n\n**Urban Farmer (Land).** Grows food on roofs, balconies and forgotten lots.\n\n**Satellite Imagery Analyst (Space).** Reads Earth from orbit: crops, floods and forests.\n\n## Cities and climate\n\n**Wayfinding Designer (Cities).** Helps you find Platform 6 without asking a stranger.\n\n**Carbon Accountant (Climate).** Counts invisible exhaust the way a CA counts money.\n\n**Heat-action Planner (Climate).** Designs cities that don't cook their poorest residents.\n\n**Playground Designer (Play).** Invents safe danger, the kind that grows courage.\n\n## Sport and games\n\n**Sports Data Analyst (Sport).** Turns a cricket match into numbers a coach can use.\n\n**Pitch Curator (Sport).** Grows a cricket square like a living instrument.\n\n**Esports Coach (Games).** Treats a team like athletes, from sleep to match review to nerves.\n\n## Machines and safety\n\n**Ethical Hacker (Cyber).** Breaks in with a permission slip, then writes a report.\n\n**Conversation Designer (AI).** Writes the personality of a machine that will talk to millions.\n\n## The past\n\n**Heritage Conservator (Past).** Repairs a mural without erasing the crack that made it true.\n\n---\n\n## How to use this tour\n\nPick three jobs that made you curious. For each one, write a single question you'd ask someone who does it. Then open **Thirty Days of Looking** and use Day 12 to actually ask one.\n\nNone of these are hobbies in a costume. People file taxes doing them.",
